{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>有「港姐畫家」之稱的朱潔儀（Donna）在1989年參選港姐奪得亞軍後入行，曾參演不少劇集，直至2000年開始淡出娛樂圈，但仍不時在社交平台分享近況。近日朱潔儀曬出一系列慶生照，並寫道：「生日月最強超能力 : 食極唔肥😃😃感恩好友宴請，謝謝厚愛，盡享佳餚。❤️」</p><figure><img alt=\"慶祝生日！（IG@donnachu12）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184926233646075904457021.jpeg/1u8SooPTQj6x-UOvAxjj6ocW0N29GIehIUjD6SFIw-k\"/><figcaption>慶祝生日！（IG@donnachu12）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"慶祝生日！（IG@donnachu12）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184926231309717504401256.jpeg/LHIsTXK8uvDWehxaEj5zhxE3dUitaGK21YQU29WEFNs\"/><figcaption>慶祝生日！（IG@donnachu12）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"狀態極佳！（IG@donnachu12）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184926228759449600453602.jpeg/_JiXMNk3oCXQBdoicVaBvctG38wR37L1hbLjtIWy47Q\"/><figcaption>狀態極佳！（IG@donnachu12）</figcaption></figure><p>59歲朱潔儀慶生狀態極佳　退圈後進修藝術畫作成就備受肯定</p><p>相中所見，朱潔儀捧著鮮花與生日蛋糕留影，氣色紅潤、皮膚白滑，完全看不出已經59歲，狀態極佳，凍齡有術驚艷不少網民！朱潔儀淡出幕前後專注進修藝術，她曾修讀香港城市大學及香港中文大學所開辦的藝術課程，其後更拜水墨畫大師王無邪為師學藝，努力鑽研畫功及寫書法，尤其擅長畫花，她舉辦過畫展，出版過畫冊，作品先後在北京、上海、澳洲、日本、韓國等地展出，更獲寧波美術館、北京恭王府、新加坡孫中山紀念館收藏，藝術成就備受肯定。</p><figure><img alt=\"有「港姐畫家」之稱。（IG@donnachu12）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184926452877889536721034.jpeg/3si1FNY_coxkJMsO3IlqHIU6j7PqMz70VXK7TlVyu04\"/><figcaption>有「港姐畫家」之稱。（IG@donnachu12）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有「港姐畫家」之稱。（IG@donnachu12）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184926564970663936814207.jpeg/6wgfMmtvIEwtJzVrxFM_5sfCuLsc0OlqpDj-bqQ4_m4\"/><figcaption>有「港姐畫家」之稱。（IG@donnachu12）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"開畫展。（IG@donnachu12）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184927622707286016283470.jpeg/FzHLeGkQZaZGfHczY05RW8levp4Qnr6lWi6uoFourqA\"/><figcaption>開畫展。（IG@donnachu12）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"開畫展。（IG@donnachu12）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184927619771142144624130.jpeg/q9uIWTBvcOgejx9YPp4RRnoQvBSKj0rcS2E3wUthN8E\"/><figcaption>開畫展。（IG@donnachu12）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"藝術造詣深厚。（IG@donnachu12）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184927615660593152762341.jpeg/wqpqxPYq7j2gppTMgtkUggZHCRyZaMJEswTMKLMEzCg\"/><figcaption>藝術造詣深厚。（IG@donnachu12）</figcaption></figure><p>朱潔儀投資有道躋身富婆行列　住淺水灣3,000呎「花園屋」豪宅</p><p>除了藝術造詣深厚，據知朱潔儀亦擅長投資及經商，早已躋身富婆行列，家住淺水灣逾3,000呎「花園屋」豪宅，屋內裝修簡約大氣，空間闊落，而戶外就有兩個露台大花園，園內種滿各式花草植物。雖然朱潔儀至今未婚，但依然樂得自在，平時會在花園運動或歎茶，生活寫意。</p><figure><img alt=\"淺水灣豪宅。（IG@donnachu12）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184927925842481152925617.jpeg/zDLMQzsPGsva3MzEAl7U0-D101THzr78NkHcbDZB3Gw\"/><figcaption>淺水灣豪宅。（IG@donnachu12）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"淺水灣豪宅。（IG@donnachu12）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184927923296407552901286.jpeg/U_uEZVLnkJNw0W82FrCQP9h7S8bTrItK6oevI-qHryM\"/><figcaption>淺水灣豪宅。（IG@donnachu12）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"花園寫生。（IG@donnachu12）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184927920989409280738256.jpeg/gxQwlVgvM-S5uyFISEdCvYL1h441sjR7iwnG3IsJxtw\"/><figcaption>花園寫生。（IG@donnachu12）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"豪宅花園。（IG@donnachu12）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184927918543998976406875.jpeg/XJ0S58O0w2aJNgS1U0DHuMbQqzeb1XniYGGAUWBhgFE\"/><figcaption>豪宅花園。（IG@donnachu12）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"豪宅花園。（IG@donnachu12）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184927915935010816786950.jpeg/hsrMFwMT_jGfNmG2_nNERF1ZoaUV9Cg07hQb3e4UG90\"/><figcaption>豪宅花園。（IG@donnachu12）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有兩個陽台。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210924/518183374544703488256973.jpeg/tEeWbAUNxLKOCBvYl_1dFXJlcJdabrdZNgebGjYHmxo\"/><figcaption>有兩個陽台。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大花園。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210924/518183882479112192897240.jpeg/MaRKEN2dFQnrEJbqdxX0FussDZ6lb-Owqj1lQqo9ZUI\"/><figcaption>大花園。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大花園。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210924/518184026465374208789431.jpeg/Ls0NXUS-tWvM7agwEzz8nuTE7hoBcyXBszZJcLM2SXA\"/><figcaption>大花園。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大花園。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210924/518184220338688000582067.jpeg/bbW8tguPPj2zY6GxmI6S5G5JIAqh3NetTBbGg0wWxoM\"/><figcaption>大花園。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"環境清幽。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210924/518184641300008960893026.jpeg/pbnYZAVg1zobInNcZTi7gq1vXyFycWC-PV2g1D1doNQ\"/><figcaption>環境清幽。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"環境清幽。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210924/518185557919010816073592.jpeg/KyCQYEf0OcDSS_lWNgulAC06kSbRZKxi_9y7Rv_cu0Y\"/><figcaption>環境清幽。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"裝修簡約大氣。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210924/518187118569197568536712.jpeg/4UO9J6zkejZBd-PEuL2Gb8Tj5UM6C5s1phNROKYTUTg\"/><figcaption>裝修簡約大氣。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"裝修簡約大氣。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210924/518187552230871040379814.jpeg/2nxtK5WA4Fprc-znDG9_mO_Ss6ctF1L7x9X7AcfV-wE\"/><figcaption>裝修簡約大氣。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"花園。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210924/518192955480084480756084.jpeg/PJiyK4RHwW234dGzDZ7Eu5wf6etkaQH4DypIXg8qSF4\"/><figcaption>花園。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"花園。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210924/518193298741923840853971.jpeg/ZhSu2tXCRUBcO28l6TZ_hCKY-3lIM0QqRSHCzEUhwsw\"/><figcaption>花園。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"飯廳。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210924/518195157850394624568023.jpeg/D7m1d3Haidps6P8Dbi1HSViXi_P02y--1GiY39RomN8\"/><figcaption>飯廳。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"做運動。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210924/518195989736067072012698.jpeg/Y3_O5IFWDc5iT6zoeaZQ9vZT0o0xtH-EbBCwSGwQsEg\"/><figcaption>做運動。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大廳。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210924/518196709352804352194763.jpeg/T98FP001Y6E6DKRKmmneO33gV7lqZiTHHZmbax2Zm2s\"/><figcaption>大廳。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"水池。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210924/518197263114178560028516.jpeg/Q6a7Ao-zLUIeWFJXCtDvMeFpfO5c-A-gEfVDxRH1Q8U\"/><figcaption>水池。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"仲有另一個花園。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210924/518197527342747648637921.jpeg/RLCtvfqTC-I8QlSXDD0ZQ9K2fUcNxXwHouHq-6Lh6vs\"/><figcaption>仲有另一個花園。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"環境清幽。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210924/518199177172226048758416.jpeg/vSDw7xtXeKNO5gbk7XRY76aqyIWz4TPeN1DOlzdQzpc\"/><figcaption>環境清幽。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"舒適。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210924/518199472983904256534701.jpeg/KhlFoUZ--xyXSUiw-CUjA7cYbA2097UUGv8Q9xr_EPc\"/><figcaption>舒適。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T22:19:37.844128+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1005,"images":30,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}